---
/** Lake house and rental section, the main local angle for Montgomery. */
---

<section class="section lk" aria-labelledby="lake-h">
  <div class="wrap lk__in">
    <div>
      <p class="lk__label">Lake Conroe homes</p>
      <h2 id="lake-h">Weekend homes and rentals, cleaned between visits</h2>
      <p>A lot of homes on the west side of the lake are weekend places or short-term rentals. Wet towels, sand and a different group every weekend wear carpet and cushions down quickly, and guests notice.</p>
      <p>Send your check-out and check-in times with your quote request, and the cleaning is scheduled in the gap with time to dry.</p>
      <p><a href="/services/lake-house-rental-cleaning">More about rental turnovers</a></p>
    </div>
    <ul class="lk__list">
      <li><strong>Between guests.</strong> Fit into your turnover window.</li>
      <li><strong>Season open and close.</strong> Freshen carpet and cushions in spring, or before you shut the house for winter.</li>
      <li><strong>No one home?</strong> Many owners share a door code. We confirm every detail ahead of time.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lk__in { display: grid; gap: 2rem; }
  .lk__label { text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-weight: 800; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--accent-dark); margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .lk__list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: .75rem; align-content: start; }
  .lk__list li { border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); background: var(--bg-soft); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) { .lk__in { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; } }
</style>
